<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;BSF troops shot dead a Pakistani intruder attempting to cross the border in Punjab, while Pakistan condemned a Houthi militia attack on a tower in Riyadh and pledged solidarity with Saudi Arabia. Saudi and Turkish officials arrived in Pakistan for trilateral defence talks aimed at addressing the Saudi-Houthi escalation in Yemen. Taliban forces in Afghanistan killed six young men from Panjshir after they failed to stop at a checkpoint. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNLXl5NEJ2REhHeDFhcHdGWkRBVHdTVUZOMS1pUk8ySWxjT3A5ZWU0Y1VJdEZ5OGxIV2xTNWFLTDNoX0E0dmJ3dUUtTDNEcWQyZTMzZ2syZkh3SmJra3BYMlNnX1BhYzFfUXFSNU9rRTFQZm0wM2xLOFB2YzZhTFJ2NWg2bG41Z2xtcjFidXBkMWgtZ3dhMUpzVDNyTS1pdXAyLTRPbWxfa0ZzMWk3clYtemE4WjI4XzJCZXRKVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pakistan Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOcktvajZJR3NPM1NhUDZBZzg3bjViRlJKQ2hxOG02RXJLQmtSRXo3QmluZmdIdEQ2UGp3bGRhN2hGM2NzN3padjRLRVM5RUxILTN1djA0TTFKanJ3ZWtEek03cDdfVzJuYlRYMFdPQlhiZUVYY3c0RHp2S2JGVlZiLUlxMUthWVhlY3FybVUzbWoxcXBENi1CU3J5bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UrduPoint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQSHVhZVhOUm5Cc29YUDFUYTllNGxPSEl2WUE2WDVObVVGc2lBVGlqb21wUWZvSkptNWdhRmdnNGljRUZnQUZLT29fR1JjeGlNRmdXdzA1WXZKMmdtYUtVVy1TMU1VWU9ld05LbVQwWm9lOXpCdkxrbTZsZk9PNVhTQjVyYk9RdGZaekZ6dlVJbUdwVzdlOTZFZFdGOUwwU0piQ2pPMUQwV1BBc0N5NzR6cXNrZDlXNWxOUDl1aVFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;WRAL&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE4yZ1k1dmlHR0daTldJQUZtM0ZGV2VJd1hDR2RhbzBITVFZdTUyOXpiWHJBSWFIYUtHZXRBVGdGNkVDNTUxWk9paXJZaFZMM